comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-13T00:17:54.420Z",codex-ops268-1112,"The fixture records the real repaired #265 receipt (artifact 13861624524); tests add generic Sourcery and cubic text before/after the record. Duplicate markers, missing terminators and invalid JSON remain strict refusals."
  "2026-11-13T00:20:20.720Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Revert proof: restoring only the original parseCandidateReceipt function makes the real #265 body plus generic Sourcery/cubic text regression fail. Restored implementation passes. Duplicate-marker, missing-terminator and invalid-JSON refusals remain exercised; these were pre-existing guards and correctly still refuse with the original parser."
  "2026-11-13T00:21:14.572Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Final bounded local gate: timeout 1200 node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-discovery-evidence.test.ts test/daily-release-workflow.test.ts test/release-runtime.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts test/release-provenance.test.ts test/release-recovery-signer.test.ts test/release-continuation-adapter.test.ts passes 149/149, zero failures/skips. All four direct importers of the changed adapter are included. timeout 1200 npm run lint, timeout 1200 npm run typecheck and timeout 1200 npm run build:test pass. Linked pm tests pass: diagnosis 5/5, receipt 2/2, publishing identity 9/9. Full release:check is delegated to CI per the task gate budget; no full-gate or hosted-release certification is claimed. Changelog regeneration and check follow these final tracker writes."
